artifacts.api:
POST /orders
Authorization: Bearer <customer token>
Idempotency-Key: <client-generated, one per order>
Body: {"items": [...]}

201 Created: {"order_id": ..., "items": [...]}
A request with a key that was seen before gets the stored response, so a retry never creates a second order.
